{"title":"2012 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems/Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Which of the following numbers is equal to 33 million?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/6/c/86cae5d5144a55ca06a00eb8e8f4a4192b4dbab6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{ (A) }\\ 3~300~000 \\qquad\\text{ (B) }\\ 330~000 \\qquad\\text{ (C) }\\ 33~000 \\qquad\\text{ (D) }\\ 33~000~000 \\qquad\\text{ (E) }\\ 330~000~000$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"705\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/6/f/b6f3bccae16d5e31266370fced24edc41538d5da.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$33$\" width=\"17\" height=\"12\" /> million is equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/5/7/957e53543b899884aa72ad84d5581e6784040f67.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf {(D) } 33~000~000}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"133\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)\" title=\"2012 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7)\">2012 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7)</a></b> (<b>